+#### Lease Permit Forwarding & Factory Verification
+1. **Permit Binding**: In `asr_loading_adapter.py` lines 191–240 (`_model_session`), the adapter obtains `lease` from `SNAPSHOT_LIFECYCLE.read_lease(...)` and calls `permit = lease.begin_native_session()`.
