+3. **Local Constructor Binding**: Line 207 calls `binding = resolver.bind_for_constructor(admission)`. It verifies:
+   - `type(binding) is resolver.LocalBinding`
+   - `binding.choice == choice`
+   - `binding.revision == permit.record.key.revision`
+   - `binding.manifest_sha256 == authority.manifest_approval.manifest_sha256`
